Package: stablemap
Type: Package
Title: Stabilized Disease Mapping
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dai-Rong", "Tsai", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "darrentsai1222@gmail.com",
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1372-4473"))
Description: This package provides statistical methods for stabilized disease mapping
    and tools for generating space-time simulation data.
    The supported methods include:
    stabilized kriging (Hsu et al., 2023) <<doi:10.2188/jea.JE20210276>>,
    stabilized spatiotemporal kriging (Tsai et al., 2022) <<doi:10.1186/s12874-022-01749-9>>,
    age-period-cohort kriging, etc.
